{"id":45497,"date":"2025-10-05T07:40:41","date_gmt":"2025-10-05T06:40:41","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-de-copenhaga-2026\/"},"modified":"2026-09-19T21:04:26","modified_gmt":"2026-09-19T20:04:26","slug":"meia-maratona-de-copenhaga","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-de-copenhaga\/","title":{"rendered":"Meia Maratona de Copenhaga 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Meia Maratona de Copenhaga 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Meia Maratona de Copenhaga 2027<\/strong> (CPH Half) \u00e9 uma das meias-maratonas mais r\u00e1pidas e prestigiadas do atletismo mundial, integrando o conceituado circuito internacional <strong>SuperHalfs<\/strong> e detendo o selo de qualidade <strong>World Athletics Road Race<\/strong>. Com partida e chegada tra\u00e7adas nas amplas avenidas de <strong>Copenhaga<\/strong> e <strong>Frederiksberg<\/strong>, na <strong>Dinamarca<\/strong>, a prova re\u00fane 45.000 atletas de todo o mundo num ambiente festivo inigual\u00e1vel, com ruas repletas de m\u00fasica e entusiasmo.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Famosa pelo seu tra\u00e7ado plano e veloz, a Meia Maratona de Copenhaga \u00e9 o palco ideal para bater recordes pessoais e viver uma jornada atl\u00e9tica inesquec\u00edvel pela capital dinamarquesa. Com forte procura global que ultrapassa as 100.000 inscri\u00e7\u00f5es em sorteio, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>Sparta Athletics &#038; Running<\/strong> disponibiliza lebres de ritmo (pacers), m\u00faltiplos postos de abastecimento, seguran\u00e7a exemplar, transmiss\u00e3o mundial e a cobi\u00e7ada medalha de finalista v\u00e1lida para o passaporte SuperHalfs.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">19 de Setembro de 2027 \u00e0s 09:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">\u00d8sterbro, Copenhaga, Dinamarca<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">21,0975 km (Meia-Maratona)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Sparta Athletics &#038; Running<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">3h00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/cphhalf.dk\/en\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Consultar Regulamento Oficial &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Meia-Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Meia Maratona (21.0975K)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 19 Set 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e hor\u00e1rio oficial da Meia Maratona de Copenhaga 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no domingo, 19 de setembro de 2027, com partida marcada para as 09:30 nas art\u00e9rias centrais de Copenhaga e Frederiksberg, na Dinamarca.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e a lotaria de vagas da CPH Half 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Devido \u00e0 elevada procura internacional com mais de 100.000 interessados para 45.000 lugares, as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem atrav\u00e9s de uma lotaria oficial gratuita no portal cphhalf.dk, onde os atletas sorteados garantem o direito de compra do dorsal.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A prova faz parte do circuito europeu SuperHalfs?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim. A Meia Maratona de Copenhaga \u00e9 uma das seis etapas fundadoras da s\u00e9rie SuperHalfs, permitindo aos participantes carimbar o seu SuperPassport juntamente com Lisboa, Praga, Berlim, Cardiff e Val\u00eancia rumo \u00e0 SuperMedalha.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia oficial e o perfil altim\u00e9trico do percurso?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O percurso tem a dist\u00e2ncia oficial homologada de 21,0975 km. \u00c9 amplamente reconhecido como um dos mais planos e r\u00e1pidos do mundo, sendo recordista em marcas internacionais de elite e de atletas amadores.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de atleta e os servi\u00e7os de apoio na prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O participante tem direito a dorsal com chip de cronometragem, seguro desportivo, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, abastecimentos energ\u00e9ticos e l\u00edquidos na prova e na meta, apoio m\u00e9dico e medalha oficial de finalista com grava\u00e7\u00e3o de tempo.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Meia Maratona de Copenhaga 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-09-19\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"\u00d8sterbro, Copenhaga\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Copenhaga\", \"addressRegion\": \"Dinamarca\", \"addressCountry\": \"DK\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Sparta Athletics & Running\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e hor\u00e1rio oficial da Meia Maratona de Copenhaga 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no domingo, 19 de setembro de 2027, com partida marcada para as 09:30 nas art\u00e9rias centrais de Copenhaga e Frederiksberg, na Dinamarca.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e a lotaria de vagas da CPH Half 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Devido \u00e0 elevada procura internacional com mais de 100.000 interessados para 45.000 lugares, as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem atrav\u00e9s de uma lotaria oficial gratuita no portal cphhalf.dk, onde os atletas sorteados garantem o direito de compra do dorsal.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A prova faz parte do circuito europeu SuperHalfs?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim. A Meia Maratona de Copenhaga \u00e9 uma das seis etapas fundadoras da s\u00e9rie SuperHalfs, permitindo aos participantes carimbar o seu SuperPassport juntamente com Lisboa, Praga, Berlim, Cardiff e Val\u00eancia rumo \u00e0 SuperMedalha.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia oficial e o perfil altim\u00e9trico do percurso?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O percurso tem a dist\u00e2ncia oficial homologada de 21,0975 km. \u00c9 amplamente reconhecido como um dos mais planos e r\u00e1pidos do mundo, sendo recordista em marcas internacionais de elite e de atletas amadores.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui o kit de atleta e os servi\u00e7os de apoio na prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O participante tem direito a dorsal com chip de cronometragem, seguro desportivo, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, abastecimentos energ\u00e9ticos e l\u00edquidos na prova e na meta, apoio m\u00e9dico e medalha oficial de finalista com grava\u00e7\u00e3o de tempo.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":67730,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,41],"event_type_2":[1466,627],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[882],"class_list":["pos